Bonjour ! Yes, I’d be happy to help you choose the right mattress 🙂

Could you tell me:

whether you sleep alone or with a partner;
your main sleeping position;
your approximate build;
the size you need;
and whether you prefer a plush, balanced or firmer feel?

With these details, I can point you towards the most suitable model.

I am Sébastien, the AI agent at Tediber.

I do my best to provide you with a clear, fast, and helpful response. However, like any assistant based on artificial intelligence, it is possible that some information may be incomplete or require verification.

If your request is complex, specific, or if you have any doubts, please do not hesitate to let us know. A member of our team will be happy to take over.

Our goal is simple: to offer you a reliable response and quality service, whether through Sébastien… or a human. 😊

Yes. The Matelas Hybride Premium has a 10-year warranty for the original buyer when purchased directly from Tediber or an authorised Tediber boutique, with proof of purchase.

It covers confirmed manufacturing defects, including:

visible sagging of more than 2.5 cm;
physical defects causing a crack or significant deformation;
manufacturing defects in the cover;
persistent rubbing noise between the springs and foam.

If the defect is confirmed, Tediber may repair or replace the defective product or part, with delivery covered. The warranty does not provide a refund. It excludes normal wear, normal loss of firmness, comfort preferences, misuse, unauthorised modifications, use on an electric bed base, and mattresses not unpacked within 30 days of delivery.

You also have 100 nights to try the mattress at home, with free returns if it does not suit you. This trial is separate from the 10-year warranty.
